/* Factorial experiment to tune choise of SH iterations randomopt
	for top query and nested subqueries. Dynamic query processing.
	Fast stat collecting.
	It is run on t.root file.
	Run with run.root.sh and load master.current.aucm.hagrid.osql 
	from osql */
